WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.339
Kɔmɔt na payroll officer training.

2
00:00:02.339 --> 00:00:09.037
Na ya sɛf salary dɛn kin tɔn to payment dɛn — kɔrɛkt, pan taym, ɛn ful compliant wit Sierra Leone in taks lɔ.

3
00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:17.578
Wi go rɔn wan payroll preview, ɔndastand di gross-to-net calculation, export payslip dɛn ɛn bank file dɛn, ɛn luk pan statutory compliance.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.812
Dis na di payroll page. Pik di mɔnt ɛn yia, dɛn ɔltɛm preview bifo yu rɔn.

5
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:35.818
Di preview kin kɔmpit ɛvri wok man in gross pay, put di NRA progressive PAYE bands, kɔmɔt di fayv pɔsɛnt NASSIT employee contribution, put ɛni lon ripemɛnt dɛn — ɛn sho yu di ɛgzakt nɛt pay, wit natin kɔmit yɛt.

6
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.370
We di preview luk rayt, di run button kin kɔmit am.

7
00:00:55.370 --> 00:01:10.298
Fɔ gɔvmɛnt tenant dɛn, SaloneHCM fɔs vɛrɛfay di budget check fɔ di piriod, rispɛkt di payroll cut-off lock, ɛn rut di rɔn insayd di Ministry of Finance approval chain — usay di rikwayd nɔmba fɔ difrɛnt signɛcho dɛn fɔ kɔlɛkt bifo di rɔn apruvd.

8
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.065
Ɛvri kɔmplit rɔn kin apia na di history bilow.

9
00:01:14.065 --> 00:01:25.938
Frɔm dɛ yu dawnlod pɔsin-pɔsin payslip PDF dɛn, sɛn bɔlk payslip SMS mɛsej dɛn, ɛn jɛnɛret bank disbursement file dɛn insayd Rokel, SLCB, UBA, ɔ Ecobank format — rɛdi fɔ ɔplod to yu bank portal.

10
00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:35.269
Di compliance page kin trak yu statutory obligation dɛn: mɔnt-mɔnt PAYE return dɛn to di NRA ɛn NASSIT contribution schedule dɛn.

11
00:01:35.269 --> 00:01:41.610
SaloneHCM kin jɛnɛret di export dɛn insayd di ɛgzakt ɛkspɛkt format — pik di piriod, jɛnɛret, ɛn fayl.

12
00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.786
Deadline dɛn trak so natin no slip.

13
00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:52.278
Di golden rule dɛn: preview bifo yu rɔn, nɛva baypass wan blɔk budget check, ɛn fayl return dɛn bifo di deadline.

14
00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:57.130
Tek di payroll officer quiz insayd di Training Center fɔ sɛtifay yu skill dɛn.
